			],
			"Message": "build(Wind): Minify ESBuild configuration and clean compiled output\n\nTransform source configuration files in Configuration/ESBuild/ from readable multi-line format to minified single-line JavaScript. Clean up the Target/ compiled output directory by removing source maps and excluding unused type definition files. Expand README.md with comprehensive documentation including installation instructions, usage examples, service table, and updated project structure.\n\nThis optimizes bundle size by removing debug information and unused type files while improving the README with actionable developer documentation.",
